# Kishla Skimmer: "Whenever a card leaves your graveyard during your turn, draw a card. This ability triggers only once each
# turn." On turn 1 Bot1 returns the sacrificed Black Lotus with Auroral Procession (one draw), then returns that Auroral
# Procession with a second one (a second card leaving the graveyard this turn: no second draw). On Bot2's turn 2 Tormod's Crypt
# exiles Bot1's graveyard: cards leave it, but not during Bot1's turn, so there is no draw.

